{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":53715,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793472278215,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2012,"episodeCount":26,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mSn4zHP7j6QQTDEcD3731Yr2LDJ.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"924509","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The leader of the \"Little Busters,\" Kyousuke, returns to school after a job hunting break and calls the old gang together. He suggests that they all do something that they can only do now, while they're young - and that something is playing baseball. Now all Kyousuke, Riki, Masato, Kengo, and Rin need to do is find enough new members to make a complete baseball team...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lFFY1R7ma9sKHWrp9gx0Xa9MvKX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lFFY1R7ma9sKHWrp9gx0Xa9MvKX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"924506","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Riki meets the cheerful, easygoing Komari on a visit to the school rooftop, and decides to invite her to join the Little Busters. Meanwhile, one of the cats Rin is taking care of strolls along with a mysterious note tied to its tail...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/upiu4g3wUHVq37Y4s3ru4UEuxPd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/upiu4g3wUHVq37Y4s3ru4UEuxPd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"924502","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Riki is called out for tea and a chat by Kurugaya Yuiko, a mysterious girl who rarely shows up to class. He invites her to join the Little Busters, but when she meets the team's resident musclebrain, Masato, sparks instantly fly.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sgyQuBZpxGdhFk5y6kk5ncXNDQT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sgyQuBZpxGdhFk5y6kk5ncXNDQT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"924503","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"On the school roof, Riki catches Komari whispering something about an older brother in her sleep. But when she wakes up, she tells him that she's an only child and her brother only appears to her in dreams, where he reads her a sad story from a picture book only to fade away when she awakens...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5QAmZdJ9n36p6FcQAbhRu6dC24N.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5QAmZdJ9n36p6FcQAbhRu6dC24N.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"924504","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Komari's normally cheerful smiles begin to look sad and lonely, Riki decides to cheer her up by searching for her older brother... but does he really exist? The next day, the two of them pay a visit to Komari's hometown in hopes of recovering her lost memories.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-11-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hgre5WT0IEtSrMtGICAhOFa7sFt.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hgre5WT0IEtSrMtGICAhOFa7sFt.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"924505","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Komari has finally recovered her memories of her older brother - and it has left her in a tragic state of confusion. With the support of the Little Busters, Riki sets out to bring Komari's cheerful smile back.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-11-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zQwirPqLvlIiwWcBdiTSioO6tFX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQwirPqLvlIiwWcBdiTSioO6tFX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"924500","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Little Busters are still short a few members, so Riki decides to invite a girl from a neighboring class, Saigusa Haruka, to the team. But the energetic, playful Haruka has a reputation for being the school's biggest troublemaker, and is under constant pursuit by the school's Disciplinary Committee.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-11-17","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2hxvn7Rlmkc8hbmmdkIE4iezwYY.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2hxvn7Rlmkc8hbmmdkIE4iezwYY.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"924501","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Riki sees Kud playing Frisbee with her dogs, he knows that her quick, agile movements would make her a good candidate for the Little Busters and extends the invitation. But Kud hasn't had an easy time making friends since she came to Japan, and she could use the help of her new teammates to find a willing dorm roommate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-11-24","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qpIJyHPEkCdokwpeARerqmkE87v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qpIJyHPEkCdokwpeARerqmkE87v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"924512","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"One of Rin's cats brings her yet another mysterious note. This time its cryptic demand is to \"save the school cafeteria\" - but none of the Little Busters can see what about the cafeteria needs saving.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-12-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6KgziwsakiCCm6aSWbq2GXX9aX9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6KgziwsakiCCm6aSWbq2GXX9aX9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/53715/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"924516","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While searching for a stray ball sent flying at a Little Busters practice, Riki encounters Mio, a girl who always sits and reads in the shade of a tree with a parasol open. There's one book she's particularly fond of, but she won't tell Riki what it's about. When she loses the book, it's up to Riki to help her find it.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-12-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kauSR8VwKD0a3HTW6R1u3XSh0hF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kauSR8VwKD0a3HTW6R1u3XSh0hF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"so